  "description": "Desperate to support his grandmother, Jeong Taeju works every odd job imaginable until an unjust theft framed on him leaves him buried under astronomical loan shark debt. Coerced into working at the high-end host bar Maehwa, Taeju finds himself trapped in a dangerous underworld. A warning from the kitchen chef fails to stop Taeju from entering the notorious VVIP suite. Inside, amidst bloodied men and ruthless mobsters, sits Executive VP Gye Beomho. When a simple serving task earns Taeju a mind-blowing tip, a dangerous glimmer of hope takes hold. He thinks he can use Beomho's fortune to clear his debt and escape, but accepting money from a beast like Beomho comes with a lethal price. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
